{"id":"38164497986e2573","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-subformula-property.md","title":"证明的严格子公式性质","display":"df-subformula-property — 证明的严格子公式性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-subformula-property","aliases":["18-df-subformula-property","18-df-039"],"display":"df-subformula-property — 证明的严格子公式性质","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","[[18-df-formula]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-subformula-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-subformula-property</span><span>18-df-039</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subformula-property — 证明的严格子公式性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\">\\(\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a> 的双边证明树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0,\\pi_1\">\\(\\pi_0,\\pi_1\\)</span> 是相继式有序对投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G,A\">\\(F,G,A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 的公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 原子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFree}\\)</span> 取所列上游定义。本节引入集合值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub},\\mathrm{Formulas},\\mathrm{EndSub}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub},\\mathrm{Formulas},\\mathrm{EndSub}\\)</span> 及谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(\\neg F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\circ G\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(Qx F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Qx F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N}(\\pi_0(\\ell(n))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{F\\in\\pi_0(\\ell(r))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(r))}\\mathrm{Sub}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(\\neg F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\circ G\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(Qx F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Qx F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N}(\\pi_0(\\ell(n))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{F\\in\\pi_0(\\ell(r))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(r))}\\mathrm{Sub}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\to\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\to\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地严格语法子公式谓词，所有辅助集合在此展开，去除跨书不相容调用。它不是“所有无切一阶证明都有严格子公式性质”的断言：量词实例 F(t) 通常不是 ∀xF(x) 的字面子公式；若要陈述适合一阶系统的定理，还须定义代入实例闭包并限定演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边证明树。$\\pi_0,\\pi_1$ 是相继式有序对投影；$F,G,A$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的公式，$A$ 原子，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 是 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边证明树。$\\pi_0,\\pi_1$ 是相继式有序对投影；$F,G,A$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的公式，$A$ 原子，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_0,\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"F,G,A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub},\\mathrm{Formulas},\\mathrm{EndSub}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sub}(A)&\\coloneqq\\{A\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(\\neg F)&\\coloneqq\\{\\neg F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(F\\circ G)&\\coloneqq\\{F\\circ G\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F)\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sub}(Qx F)&\\coloneqq\\{Qx F\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Sub}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in N}(\\pi_0(\\ell(n))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(n))),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{F\\in\\pi_0(\\ell(r))\\cup\\pi_1(\\ell(r))}\\mathrm{Sub}(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubformulaProperty}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T)\\to\\mathrm{Formulas}(\\mathcal T)\\subseteq\\mathrm{EndSub}(\\mathcal T)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1872,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-subformula-property]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-subformula-property]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-subformula-property]]"}],"outgoing":["68c5bcff4a164cd8","570d01ae273edcd2","2718a8a11c383b33"]}